@startuml State Diagram - Room State Management

!define RECTANGLE class

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #E8F4F8
skinparam stateBorderColor #4A90E2

title GupShup Cafe - Room State Management

state "Room Not Exists" as NotExists
state "Room Created" as Created
state "Waiting for Participants" as Waiting
state "Participants Joining" as Joining
state "Ready Check" as ReadyCheck
state "Discussion Active" as Active
state "Discussion Ended" as Ended
state "Room Cleanup" as Cleanup

[*] --> NotExists

NotExists --> Created : First user joins room\nget_room(room_id)

Created --> Waiting : Room initialized with:\n- participants: []\n- discussion.active: false\n- createdAt: timestamp

Waiting --> Joining : add_user_to_room()\nEmit: participants-update

Joining --> Joining : More users join\nadd_user_to_room()

Joining --> ReadyCheck : User marks ready\nupdate_user(isReady: true)

ReadyCheck --> ReadyCheck : Users toggle ready\nEmit: participants-update

ReadyCheck --> Joining : User unmarks ready\nupdate_user(isReady: false)

ReadyCheck --> Active : All ready (min 2)\nstart_discussion()

state Active {
    state "Speaking Turn" as Speaking
    state "Timer Running" as Timer
    state "Waiting for Next" as NextWait
    state "Agent Feedback" as AgentTurn
    
    [*] --> Speaking
    
    Speaking --> Timer : Start timer (60s)\nSet currentSpeakerIndex\nEmit: next-turn
    
    Timer --> Timer : Countdown\nEmit: timer-update (every 1s)
    
    Timer --> NextWait : Timer expires OR\nUser clicks next
    
    Timer --> AgentTurn : Agent's turn
    
    AgentTurn --> NextWait : Feedback provided\nEmit: agent-feedback
    
    NextWait --> Speaking : next_speaker()\nAdvance to next participant
    
    Speaking --> [*] : Discussion ends
}

Active --> Ended : end_discussion() called:\n- Insufficient participants\n- Manual end\n- All rounds complete

state Ended {
    state "Saving Session" as Save
    state "Generating Summary" as Summary
    state "Broadcasting End" as Broadcast
    
    [*] --> Save
    Save --> Summary : save_session()\nsave_participants()
    Summary --> Broadcast : Generate final feedback\nLLM summary
    Broadcast --> [*] : Emit: discussion-end
}

Ended --> Cleanup : All users leave OR\nInactivity timeout

Cleanup --> [*] : cleanup_room()\nRemove from memory

Joining --> Cleanup : All users leave\nbefore starting

Active --> Cleanup : Insufficient participants\n(< 2 remaining)

note right of NotExists
    Initial state before
    any user joins
end note

note right of Created
    Room object structure:
    {
        id: string,
        participants: [],
        discussion: {
            active: false,
            topic: null,
            currentSpeakerIndex: 0,
            speakingTime: 60,
            timeRemaining: 0,
            round: 1,
            timer: null,
            startedAt: null,
            endedAt: null
        },
        createdAt: timestamp
    }
end note

note right of ReadyCheck
    Minimum 2 participants
    must be ready to start
    
    Each participant has:
    - isReady: boolean
    - role: 'speaker' | 'listener'
end note

note right of Active
    **During discussion:**
    - Timer runs per speaker
    - Turn-based speaking
    - WebRTC audio active
    - Real-time updates
    - LLM agent monitoring
    
    **Timer Management:**
    - Default: 60 seconds
    - Configurable per room
    - Auto-advance on expire
    - Manual advance available
end note

note right of Ended
    **Session ends when:**
    1. All rounds completed
    2. Insufficient participants
    3. Manual termination
    4. System error
    
    **Final actions:**
    - Save statistics to DB
    - Generate LLM summary
    - Broadcast to clients
    - Cleanup resources
end note

note right of Cleanup
    **Cleanup triggers:**
    - All users disconnected
    - Inactivity > timeout
    - Discussion ended
    
    **Cleanup actions:**
    - Clear timers
    - Remove from rooms map
    - Release memory
end note

@enduml
